# Text normalisation. Keep the working tree platform-native, the repository LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Documentation images are ordinary blobs, deliberately.
# Git LFS is NOT used: on public GitHub its quota is shared across the account,
# and an exhausted quota stops README images rendering and hands cloners an error.
# If a genuinely large binary is ever needed, add a narrow LFS rule for that type
# alone — never a catch-all.
